rd5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75363516_2273427456184674_5101230653467287889_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P_Zr3deJSt0Q7kNvwFMEhLz&_nc_oc=AdoRWwXvDk2oeaybvO1TJJRZAq_Bic0mCWO8P_F7HWEikj8jwu6fjFcxR0X36CjZz5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMh2oLa0fG9H8ZJpJvxJHLiKsOgtsunjpFISJscnCFgGA&oe=6ADF52F2"}, "display_name": "Fail Factory! Demo", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Casual", "Arcade", "Physics", "Demo"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale. \n \nWorking in assembly stations, sorting stations and quality assurance protocol (QAP), where you\u2019ll control unfathomably large robots, you\u2019ll hone your skills in a factory that feels reactive and alive, allowing for a fully immersive experience. Designed with approachability in mind, ridiculous failure is inevitable as you work your way to the top in this vibrant, witty and comedic stress-inducing Fail Factory!.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale."}]}, "developer_name": "Armature Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/priv